W("Describe how the Think-Tank looks.", 2, "He has a huge, egg-shaped head and wears a long robe decorated with stars and circles; he sits on a raised box with his arms folded. (2)", "E"),
W("What did Think-Tank ask his mirror, and what did he want of it?", 2, "'Mirror, mirror, in my hand, who is the most fantastically intellectually gifted being in the land?' He wanted a quick answer: 'You, sir.' He smacked the mirror for being slow. (2)", "E"),
W("Who were the three members of the Martian space crew?", 2, "Captain Omega, Lieutenant Iota and Sergeant Oop. (2)", "E"),
