 ("p", "**Extract 1:** 'Mirror, mirror, in my hand. Who is the most fantastically intellectually gifted being in the land?' The mock-fairy-tale verse shows Think-Tank's vanity. His smacking the mirror for being slow shows the stupidity beneath the show of intelligence."),
